Package: bwTools
Type: Package
Title: Native R Tools for BigWig, WIG, and bedGraph Files
Version: 0.6.2
Authors@R: person("Rensc", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "rensc0718@163.com")
Description: Provides native R implementations for reading and writing local
    BigWig files, indexed genomic retrieval, interval statistics, automatic
    multi-track merging, explicit signal aggregation, and reading and writing
    WIG and bedGraph signal tracks. Version 0.6.2 hardens binary format
    detection and path encoding safety after the public API standardization. BigWig binary I/O
    uses base R random-access operations, binary encoding, and zlib compression
    without bundled C or C++ code or external UCSC executables. Public in-memory
    signal coordinates are 1-based closed.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: data.table
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
NeedsCompilation: no
